<title>USA: TABLE - American Media Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - American Media Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LANTANA, Fla. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMERICAN MEDIA INC.</p>
<p>	  UNAUDITED CONSOLIDATED CONDENSED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except earnings per share)</p>
<p>						  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						Jun 30,	    Jul 1,</p>
<p>						   1997		1996</p>
<p>					     (13 Wks)	  (14 Wks)</p>
<p> Revenues				   $82,116	   $79,849</p>
<p> Operating expenses			53,487	    51,830</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortization	  7,450	     7,193</p>
<p> Total operating expenses		60,937	    59,023</p>
<p> Operating income			  21,179	    20,826</p>
<p>Interest and</p>
<p>  other expense, net		     13,357	    15,644</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	     7,822	     5,182</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	     4,385	     3,450</p>
<p> Net income				   3,437	     1,732</p>
<p> Earnings per share			  0.08		0.04</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>equivalent common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding		     41,774	    41,773</p>
<p>Operating cash flow:</p>
<p>  Operating income			 21,179	    20,826</p>
<p>  Depreciation and amortization	 7,450	     7,193</p>
<p> Operating cash flow		     28,629	    28,019</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 includes $2 million in start up costs from launch of Soap Opera News.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
